5", "groupcolor": "#88A", "color": "#223"}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [711], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["Style: cinematic technology poster with a dark, high-contrast sci-fi interface aesthetic. The composition is dominated by a deep navy-blue radial gradient background, nearly black at the edges and subtly cyan-blue toward the upper center. Fine technical grid lines, faint circuit-like traces, small dust-like light specks, and sparse floating particles are embedded across the background, especially near the corners, creating a polished futuristic atmosphere without distracting from the central typography.\n\nIn the upper-middle area, the main title \"qwen-image2.1\" appears as the largest element in the image, centered horizontally and arranged in a single horizontal line. It uses an extra-bold sans-serif display style with wide letter spacing, a three-dimensional beveled surface, fine highlights, and a soft cold outer glow around the letter edges. The fill transitions from cyan-blue on the left through pale blue-white to warm gold on the right, making it the sole visual focal point. Directly below it, the subtitle \"文生图工作流\" is centered in medium-weight sans-serif Chinese characters, colored warm champagne gold and sized at roughly one-third of the main title. Thin glowing cyan horizontal lines extend from both sides of the subtitle, aligned with its midline, forming a continuous light band interrupted by the text.\n\nBelow the subtitle, occupying the middle-to-lower portion of the poster, numerous luminous particles and flowing light filaments converge from the left and right sides toward the center. These strands are primarily cyan-blue and warm white, with varying thicknesses, transparency, and motion blur, resembling data streams or energy trails. At the convergence point, a bright square image-frame outline emerges in the lower center. The frame has clipped geometric corners, thin neon edges, layered inner borders, and a soft self-illuminated glow that radiates outward onto the surrounding dark background. Larger, softer particles appear closer to the viewer, while smaller distant particles fade into the background, producing depth and a sense of active generation. The four corners remain darker, with subtle vignetting and faint grid details, reinforcing the refined, calm, futuristic cover-poster mood. No other text appears in the image."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 710, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [538.0350341796875, 344.864501953125], "pos": [419.12664794921875, 3046.00390625], "id": 484, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "d9c2072a2de5f51ef9898ec50ccd4dda82e16126", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#335", "groupcolor": "#88A", "color": "#223"}}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "generated_text", "links": [710], "label": "generated_text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "generated_text"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["一幅竖版科技风封面海报，深藏青色径向渐变背景，四周近墨黑、中央偏上微微泛青蓝。\n画面中上部居中是主标题\"qwen-image2.1\"，单行横向排列，无衬线超粗体，字号最大；文字采用从左至右的青蓝到暖金渐变填充，字身边缘带一圈柔和的冷色外发光，字面有轻微立体感与细高光，字距略宽，是画面唯一的视觉焦点。\n主标题正下方是副标题\"文生图工作流\"，字形为中粗无衬线，颜色为暖香槟金，字号约为主标题的三分之一，居中；副标题左右两侧各延伸出一条细窄的发光青线，与副标题中线对齐，形成一条被文字打断的水平光带。\n副标题下方、画面中部至底部为主视觉：无数发光粒子与流动光丝从画面左右两侧向中央收拢，中央浮现一个明亮、微微泛光的方形图像轮廓，轮廓四角有细窄的几何切角框线，像一张正在生成中的画框；光丝呈青蓝与暖白两色，粒子有大小虚实变化，近景粒子稍大、远景渐隐，越靠近画框越亮。\n光源来自中央发光画框的自发光，光线柔和，在深色背景上形成淡淡光晕；主标题的渐变文字自身也散出微弱的冷暖光晕；四角压暗，画面边缘有细密的科技网格线与零星浮尘光点若隐若现。\n画面中未出现其他文字。整体冷静、精致、有未来感，像一张 AI 模型正式发布封面。\n", 1024, "on", 0.7, 64, 0.95, 0.05, 1.05, 999, 0, false, false, "auto"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 703, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name":